[SIZE=5][COLOR=#FF6600][B]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.0.6 - Rapid-Click Exploit Hotfix![/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Release Date:[/B][/COLOR] October 25, 2025
[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Type:[/B][/COLOR] Security hotfix - single critical exploit fix

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#CC3300]🔒 Security Fix[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#009900][B]v3.0.6 - Rapid-Click Boss Spawn Exploit Prevention[/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Players could spawn multiple bosses by rapid-clicking pumpkin head structure
[*][B]FIXED:[/B] Exploit allowed spawning 5+ bosses within 1 second from single structure
[*][B]ADDED:[/B] Per-block click debounce (3 second default cooldown between clicks)
[*][B]IMPROVED:[/B] More consistent boss spawn behavior
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#6600CC]💡 What This Means for Admins[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]Boss Spawn Control:[/B][/COLOR]
Players can no longer exploit the pumpkin head structures by rapid-clicking:
[LIST]
[*]Zombie Boss (fence + pumpkin) - protected from rapid spawning (1 click per second maximum)
[*]Skeleton Boss (lapis + pumpkin) - protected from rapid spawning (1 click per second maximum)
[*]This is now hardcoded - ALWAYS 3 second between clicks on same block, no exceptions
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#0066CC][B]How It Works:[/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*]Each pumpkin structure tracks the last click time
[*]If clicked again within 1 second: "Boss spawn is on cooldown!" message
[*]After 1 second: next click works normally
[*]Different pumpkin structures are independent
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#FF6600]📦 Installation[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Stop your server
[*]Replace [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.5.jar[/FONT] with [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.6.jar[/FONT]
[*]Start your server
[*]No config changes needed - hotfix is fully backward compatible
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Compatibility:[/B][/COLOR] v3.0.5 → v3.0.6 = No migration (configs fully compatible)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Minecraft:[/B][/COLOR] 1.21.1+ (Paper/Purpur recommended)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Java:[/B][/COLOR] 17+

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#9900CC]✨ Release Notes[/COLOR][/SIZE]

This is a maintenance hotfix addressing a single but important exploit:
[LIST]
[*]Tight click detection prevents rapid boss spawning
[*]Individual block tracking ensures fair gameplay
[*]No breaking changes - drop-in replacement for v3.0.5
[/LIST]


